  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5029.04 Accident Report Form",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5029.04 Accident Report Form.\n\n(a) The operator shall submit the following on the accident report:\n\n(1) Date of the report;\n\n(2) Certificate of competency number;\n\n(3) Time and location of accident;\n\n(4) Name and address of person(s) injured or killed;\n\n(5) Weather conditions at time of accident;\n\n(6) Name and address of person who conducted the display;\n\n(7) Type of display firework that malfunctioned;\n\n(8) Description of the accident;\n\n(9) Cause of the accident;\n\n(10) Names and addresses of any known witnesses;\n\n(11) Name of hospital or doctor where injured person(s) was taken to;\n\n(12) Detailed description of failure, if the launching mechanism was involved; and\n\n(13) Signature of individual who conducted the display.\n\nSource. #9765-B, eff 8-2-10 (from Saf-C 5026.02(b)); ss by #12124, eff 3-6-17\n\nAPPENDIX A\n\nAPPENDIX B\n\nMATERIALS INCORPORATED BY REFERENCE\n\nRule | Title | Obtain at:\n\nSaf-C 5015.03 | National Fire Protection Association (NFPA), 10 Standard for Portable Fire Extinguishers, 2018 edition. | National Fire Protection Association One Batterymarch Park Quincy, MA 02269 Phone: 1-800-344-3555 Web site: www.nfpa.org Ordering and pricing options: Softcover or pdf - $54.00\n\nSaf-C 5016.03(c) | National Fire Protection Association (NFPA) 498 “Standard for Safe Havens and Interchange Lots for Vehicles Transporting Explosives”, 2013 Edition | National Fire Protection Association One Batterymarch Park Quincy, MA 02269 Phone: 1-800-344-3555 Web site: www.nfpa.org Ordering and pricing options: Softcover - $40.50 for non-NFPA members and $36.45 for members Online subscriptions are available at www.nfpacodesonline.org\n\nSaf-C 5017.02 | National Fire Protection Association (NFPA) 1123 “Code for Fireworks Display”, 2014 Edition. | National Fire Protection Association One Batterymarch Park Quincy, MA 02269 Phone: 1-800-344-3555 Web site: www.nfpa.org Ordering and pricing options: Softcover - $49.00 for non-NFPA members and $44.10 for members Online subscriptions are available at www.nfpacodesonline.org\n\nSaf-C 5018.01(e) | National Fire Protection Association (NFPA) 701 “Standard Methods of Fire Tests for Flame-Propagation of Textiles and Films”, 2015 Edition | National Fire Protection Association One Batterymarch Park Quincy, MA 02269 Phone: 1-800-344-355 Web site: www.nfpa.org Ordering and pricing options: Softcover - $40.50 for non-NFPA members and $36.45 for members Online subscriptions are available at www.nfpacodesonline.org\n\nSaf-C 5023.01, Saf-C 5025.01, Saf-C 5028.01 | National Fire Protection Association (NFPA) 1123 “Code for Fireworks Display”, 2014 Edition. | National Fire Protection Association One Batterymarch Park Quincy, MA 02269 Phone: 1-800-344-3555 Web site: www.nfpa.org Ordering and pricing options: Softcover - $47.50 for non-NFPA members and $42.75 for members Online subscriptions are available at www.nfpacodesonline.org",
